      "text": "## How to read this map\n\n- **Top**: start at Home \u2192 Why Games Perform.\n- **Left groups**: the 12 teardowns, grouped by HUD archetype.\n- **Right**: cross-game design pillars, then the playbooks that build each system.\n- Double-click any card to open the note.",
